    "regime_notes": "Passed the benchmark-wide absolute daily IC >= 0.0070 and absolute daily ICIR >= 0.0840 gates. 2028+ IC/ICIR = 0.033591/0.105974 over 417 dates; 2029+ = 0.068050/0.221996 over 157 dates. Small cross-asset universe requires conservative interpretation.",
    "signal_artifact": "scripts/miner_3_20290809_dispersion_residual_signal.csv",
